# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for the Vulkan lanes
# (check-vulkan with SAN=address, which builds address,undefined): the
# vendored SPIRV-Cross C API downcasts its opaque handle structs, which
# the vptr check flags on the first chain the driver builds. Not
# frontend code; anything in RetroArch itself still fails the run.
vptr:spirv_cross_c.cpp
